  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "The University of Arizona is a public land-grant research university in Tucson, Arizona, founded in 1885 as Arizona's first university. It is classified as an R1: Doctoral University with very high research activity and is a member of the prestigious Association of American Universities (AAU). With over 56,000 students and 20 colleges and schools, Arizona is a top-20 public research institution with more than $1 billion in annual research expenditures.",
      "The university is world-renowned for Astronomy and Planetary Sciences — Steward Observatory leads the Large Binocular Telescope, the Giant Magellan Telescope project, and operates Mount Lemmon and Kitt Peak. The Lunar and Planetary Laboratory led the OSIRIS-REx asteroid sample-return mission and contributed lunar maps used in the 1969 Apollo landing. Arizona ranks #5 in NASA funding nationwide.",
      "The James C. Wyant College of Optical Sciences is the top optics programme in the US, the Eller College of Management is a top-25 public business school with a flagship Management Information Systems department, and the College of Mining and Geological Engineering is ranked #1 globally. The W.A. Franke Honors College serves nearly 4,000 high-achieving undergraduates.",
      "International students join Arizona through direct admission, Arizona Global Direct pathway, or the Center for English as a Second Language. The university hosts students from 120+ countries, is a Hispanic Serving Institution (HSI), and was named a Best Value University by The Princeton Review with 9 in 10 students receiving financial aid."
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "University of Arizona — государственный исследовательский land-grant университет в Tucson, штат Arizona. Основан в 1885 — первый университет штата. Классификация R1: Doctoral University с очень высокой исследовательской активностью, член престижной Association of American Universities (AAU). 56,000+ студентов, 20 colleges and schools, top-20 public research institution с research-бюджетом более $1 млрд в год.",
      "Университет всемирно известен Astronomy и Planetary Sciences — Steward Observatory ведёт Large Binocular Telescope, проект Giant Magellan Telescope, управляет обсерваториями Mount Lemmon и Kitt Peak. Lunar and Planetary Laboratory руководила миссией OSIRIS-REx по доставке грунта астероида и подготовила лунные карты для миссии Apollo 1969 года. По NASA funding Arizona — #5 в США.",
      "James C. Wyant College of Optical Sciences — лидер по optics в США, Eller College of Management — top-25 public business school с флагманской кафедрой Management Information Systems, College of Mining and Geological Engineering — #1 в мире. W.A. Franke Honors College — почти 4,000 одарённых бакалавров.",
      "Международные студенты заходят через прямое поступление, pathway Arizona Global Direct или Center for English as a Second Language. В университете учатся представители 120+ стран; статус Hispanic Serving Institution (HSI). Princeton Review назвал Arizona Best Value University, 9 из 10 студентов получают финансовую помощь."
    ],
